{c: Verse 1}
[Em] Adhi adhi raat meri aakh khul jaave,        [C] Yaad teri seene vich khich jehi paawe
[Em] Das phir meinu hun neend kive aiwen,        [D] Soni [Bm] ye...
[Em] leke tera naam dil arzaa guzaare,        [C] Aakhiyan de athru vi sukk gaye ne saare
[Em] Teinu bhull jaan wale disde naa chaare,        [D] Soni [Bm] ye.
Nee dus ki [Em] kasoor metho hoy [C] aa,        Tu aakhiyan toh [Em] door mehto ho [C] ya
Nee dil maj [D] boor kyu [Bm] hoya,        [C] Ik waari dus [D] de za [Em] ra
[Em] Dil waale [C] puch de ne ch [D] aa,        [C] Ik waari [D] dus de za [Em] ra
